 "note": "A VolumeData with a 4 by 4 by 4 PixelTexture3D of one component: every voxel column has its own grey (64, 128, 192, 255 from left to right). The default OpacityMap turns a voxel (r) into (r, r, r, r), so a pixel is the grey of the column over the blue background. A second VolumeData with no voxels is X_ITE's default, a white 1 x 1 x 1 volume that fills its box. All zero voxels draw nothing, and dimensions 2 1 1 makes the box a flat slab.",
